      ("No new debt","calculator","A new car loan or credit card may change your approval.","Now the twist. Next, a new car loan or credit card before closing may change your approval."),
      ("Funds paper trail","cheque","Keep records showing where your down payment came from.","Then, keep records showing where your down payment came from, because your lawyer and lender may ask."),
