 cap="Caledon home. Is the water safe?\n\nBuying a rural home in Caledon? Questions to ask before you go firm: 1) Does the home have a well and septic system, or town water and sewer? 2) Ask for recent well water test results, and consider getting your own test. 3) Ask for the septic records, like pumping, repairs and past inspections. 4) Ask your inspector, or a specialist, to check the well and septic system. These are planning questions, not rules: ask your lawyer and your Realtor® how to build them into your offer.\n\nBuying in Caledon? "+INFO+"\n\n"+GEN,
